<title>GERMANY: B.U.S H1 oper profit up 35 pct.</title>
<headline>B.U.S H1 oper profit up 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    14.2    up 35 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  180     vs 5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German environmental technology group is B.U.S AG. The company said it expected to post better growth rates on sales and profits in the 1996/97 business year which will end on September 30. In 1995/96, sales grew by 38 percent to 336 million marks. Net profit rose 53 percent.</p>
</text>
